# R8 keep rules for the release build (whole-app shrinking and obfuscation).
#
# Libraries ship their own consumer rules: the Anthropic SDK (META-INF/proguard/anthropic-java-core.pro, which
# covers its Jackson models), kotlinx.serialization (generated serializers), and Room. Only gaps go here.

# AutoValue is a compile-time-only annotation referenced by OpenTelemetry (an Anthropic SDK dependency).
-dontwarn com.google.auto.value.AutoValue
